{
  "strings": [
    {
      "key": "beginningText",
      "text_en": "Would you like to play the tutorial before starting?",
      "text_es": "¿Te gustaría jugar el tutorial antes de empezar?",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/beginning",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/beginning"
    },
    {
      "key": "yesText",
      "text_en": "Yes",
      "text_es": " Sí"
    },
    {
      "key": "noText",
      "text_en": "No",
      "text_es": "No"
    },
    {
      "key": "startGameText",
      "text_en": "Start Game",
      "text_es": "Iniciar juego"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText",
      "text_en": "Let's start with plant management. Click the toggle to switch to 'Plant Mode'",
      "text_es": "Comencemos con la gestión de plantas. Haga clic en el interruptor para cambiar al 'Modo Planta'",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText2",
      "text_en": "The critical zone is the 5 feet around your house, and it's important to clear dead plants, minimize furniture, and use fire-resistant fences and gates for protection.",
      "text_es": "La zona crítica es el área de 5 pies alrededor de tu casa, y es importante retirar las plantas muertas, minimizar los muebles y usar cercas y portones resistentes al fuego para mayor protección.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText2",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText2"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText3",
      "text_en": "Plants can burn up to 3x their height, which is especially dangerous when they are near your home.",
      "text_es": "Las plantas pueden quemarse hasta 3 veces su altura, lo que es especialmente peligroso cuando están cerca de tu casa.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText3",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText3"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText4",
      "text_en": "Tap to remove the dead bushes in the critical zone.",
      "text_es": "Toca para eliminar los arbustos muertos en la zona crítica.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText4",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText4"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText5",
      "text_en": "Now that you're done cleaning, let player 2 have a turn: click on the arrow to change to the second house.",
      "text_es": "Ahora que ya terminaste de limpiar, deja que el jugador 2 tenga su turno: haz clic en la flecha para cambiar a la segunda casa.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText5",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText5"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText6",
      "text_en": "To decorate the yard, we can use fire-resistant plants. Click on the bubble to choose your plants.",
      "text_es": "Para decorar el jardín, podemos usar plantas resistentes al fuego. Haz clic en la burbuja para elegir tus plantas.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText6",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText6"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText7",
      "text_en": "Great job! Let's move on to home hardening.",
      "text_es": "¡Buen trabajo! Pasemos al refuerzo del hogar.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText7",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText7"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText8",
      "text_en": "Home hardening is a process that makes your home more resistant to wildfires. Upgrading roofing, walls, eaves, and other areas can protect embers from catching fire.",
      "text_es": "El endurecimiento del hogar es un proceso que hace que su hogar sea más resistente a los incendios forestales. La mejora de techos, las paredes, los aleros y otras áreas puede evitar que las brasas se incendien.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText8",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText8"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText9",
      "text_en": "Click on the toggle to switch to 'House Mode'",
      "text_es": "Haz clic en el interruptor para cambiar a ‘Modo Casa’.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText9",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText9"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText10",
      "text_en": "Let's try upgrading the roof. Tap to see the roofing options.",
      "text_es": "Vamos a intentar mejorar el techo. Toca para ver las opciones de techado.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText10",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText10"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText11",
      "text_en": "You can view your Owned Materials in the Inventory. Try tapping on the Inventory button to open the Inventory.",
      "text_es": "Puedes ver tus materiales propios en el inventario. Intenta tocar el botón de Inventario para abrirlo.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText11",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText11"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText12",
      "text_en": "You can always tap on the item to replace the material. Try tapping on the Wood.",
      "text_es": "Siempre puedes tocar el objeto para reemplazar el material. Intenta tocar la madera.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText12",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText12"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText13",
      "text_en": "Great job! Now try tapping on the Metal again.",
      "text_es": "¡Buen trabajo! Ahora intenta tocar el metal de nuevo.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText13",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText13"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText14",
      "text_en": "Now your roof is using Metal. You can use the inventory anytime you want to apply other materials to your house!",
      "text_es": "Ahora tu techo está usando metal. ¡Puedes usar el inventario en cualquier momento para aplicar otros materiales a tu casa!",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText14",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText14"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText15",
      "text_en": "When your budget dips lower, you may see the chance to earn more money by answering a quiz question. Try clicking on the money bag icon.",
      "text_es": "Cuando su presupuesto baja, puede ver la oportunidad de ganar más dinero respondiendo una pregunta del cuestionario. Intente hacer clic en el ícono de la bolsa de dinero.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText15",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText15"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutText16",
      "text_en": "Talk to your neighbor (Player 2) to make sure both houses are safe from fire danger.",
      "text_es": "Habla con tu vecino (Jugador 2) para asegurarte de que ambas casas estén a salvo del peligro de incendios.",
      "audioPath": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/tutText16",
      "audioPathES": "FiresafeFriend/Audio/ES/tutText16"
    },
